<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic
        SYSTEM "https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/xhtml-entities.dtd">
<topic xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://resources.jetbrains.com/writerside/1.0/topic.v2.xsd"
       title="Common support" id="common-support-library" is-library="true">

    <snippet id="support-content">
        <chapter title="Feature requests and bugs" id="feature_request_and_bug_common">
            <p>
                To report a bug or request a feature, open an issue in the public
                <a href="https://github.com/edgafner/dorkag/issues">DORKAG issue tracker on GitHub</a>.
                The tracker covers all DORKAG plugins.
            </p>
            <p>
                Pick the bug report or feature request template for your plugin, or the general one if your plugin
                has none. Name the plugin in the title, and include:
            </p>
            <list>
                <li>The plugin version and the IDE name and version (<ui-path>Help | About</ui-path>).</li>
                <li>The steps that reproduce the problem, and what you expected to happen.</li>
                <li>Relevant entries from the IDE log, with tokens and other secrets removed. To open the log folder,
                    select <ui-path>Help | Show Log in Finder</ui-path> on macOS; on Windows and Linux, the menu item
                    names your file manager.
                </li>
            </list>
        </chapter>

        <chapter title="Contact" id="contact_me_common">
            <p>
                For questions about licensing, or anything you do not want to post publicly, send an e-mail to
                <a href="mailto:jgafner@dorkag.com">jgafner@dorkag.com</a>.
            </p>
        </chapter>
    </snippet>
</topic>
